[33,"Puerto de La Libertad Community Health Unit","Unidad Comunitaria de Salud Familiar Puerto de La Libertad","Medical","La Libertad","La Libertad",13.4883,-89.3222,"🩺","Public primary-care facility near the coast. It is not a substitute for a full emergency hospital; call 132 for urgent medical assistance.","Centro público de atención primaria cerca de la costa. No sustituye a un hospital de emergencias; llama al 132 para asistencia médica urgente."],
[34,"Bitcoin Beach — El Zonte","Bitcoin Beach — El Zonte","Bitcoin","La Libertad","El Zonte",13.4938,-89.4393,"₿","The community where El Salvador’s Bitcoin movement began. Some local businesses accept Bitcoin or Lightning, but acceptance is voluntary and can change. Ask before ordering and keep USD as a backup. Last reviewed: September 2026.","La comunidad donde comenzó el movimiento Bitcoin de El Salvador. Algunos negocios aceptan Bitcoin o Lightning, pero la aceptación es voluntaria y puede cambiar. Pregunta antes de ordenar y lleva dólares como respaldo. Última revisión: septiembre de 2026."],
[35,"Punta Roca Surf Break","Ola de Punta Roca","Surf","La Libertad","La Libertad",13.4833,-89.3196,"🏄","World-class powerful right point break over a rocky bottom. Best for advanced and expert surfers; consult local guides about tides, entry and current conditions.","Potente point break de derecha de clase mundial sobre fondo rocoso. Recomendado para surfistas avanzados y expertos; consulta a guías locales sobre mareas, entrada y condiciones."],
[36,"El Sunzal Surf Break","Ola de El Sunzal","Surf","La Libertad","Tamanique",13.4940,-89.4050,"🏄‍♀️","A long right point break popular with intermediate surfers. Conditions vary; beginners should enter only with a qualified local instructor.","Point break largo de derecha popular entre surfistas intermedios. Las condiciones cambian; los principiantes deben entrar únicamente con un instructor local calificado."],
[37,"El Tunco Surf Break","Ola de El Tunco","Surf","La Libertad","El Tunco",13.4935,-89.3825,"🏄","A lively surf base with access to different nearby breaks, board rentals and lessons. Ask a surf school which break matches your level that day.","Animada base de surf con acceso a diferentes olas cercanas, alquiler de tablas y clases. Pregunta en una escuela qué ola corresponde a tu nivel ese día."],
[38,"El Zonte Surf Break","Ola de El Zonte","Surf","La Libertad","El Zonte",13.4935,-89.4398,"🏄‍♂️","A well-known surf community with several wave options. Beginners should book a lesson; rocky sections and changing swell require local advice.","Reconocida comunidad surfista con varias opciones de olas. Los principiantes deben reservar una clase; las zonas rocosas y el oleaje cambiante requieren orientación local."],
[39,"Las Flores Surf Break","Ola de Las Flores","Surf","San Miguel","Chirilagua",13.1702,-88.1045,"🌊","A high-quality right point break on the eastern coast, generally suited to intermediate and advanced surfers. Check swell and access locally.","Point break de derecha de gran calidad en la costa oriental, generalmente apto para surfistas intermedios y avanzados. Confirma el oleaje y acceso localmente."],
[40,"Punta Mango Surf Break","Ola de Punta Mango","Surf","Usulután","Jucuarán",13.1670,-88.0350,"🌊","A remote, demanding rocky wave reserved for experienced surfers on stronger days. Arrange transport and local guidance before visiting.","Ola rocosa, remota y exigente, reservada para surfistas experimentados en días fuertes. Organiza transporte y guía local antes de visitarla."]
